  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 5.1.0, a minor release: no breaking change. Notifications can be scheduled for later delivery through the outbox with ICqrsDispatcher.PublishAt / PublishAfter, in every built-in store; a scheduled publish never falls back to in-process delivery.\n            A custom request context built with the parameterless RequestContextBase() constructor costs one clock read instead of two.\n            Fixed: a pipeline behavior's next() without a token passes on the token the behavior received, as documented, instead of running the handler under CancellationToken.None.\n            Startup validation is unchanged: with no policy set it runs as ThrowOnError in the Development environment and is off elsewhere, and ValidateOnStart() turns it on everywhere (the 5.0.0 notes said it ran only with ValidateOnStart()).\n            See https://github.com/BisocM/CQRSharp/blob/v5.1.0/CHANGELOG.md for the full notes; upgrading from 5.0 needs no code or schema change.",
